    <string name="help_overlay_title">Overlay permission</string>
    <string name="help_overlay_body">Instead of accessibility, Penumbra can draw the filter with the “Display over other apps” permission. Many TVs hide this option; if yours does, grant it from a computer with ADB:</string>
    <string name="help_brightness_title">System brightness</string>
    <string name="help_brightness_body">To change the brightness, Penumbra needs the “Modify system settings” permission. If your TV hides this option, grant it from a computer with ADB:</string>
